sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant V as GUI / CLI
    participant C as MealPlannerController
    participant F as MealPlanningFacade
    participant A as MealPlanningAgent
    participant L as LLMClient
    participant PV as PlanValidator
    participant P as PlanEditParser
    participant X as CommandExecutor
    participant K as ReplaceMealCommand / RemoveMealCommand
    participant M as MealPlan
    participant SY as ShoppingListSynchronizer
    U->>V: "swap Tuesday dinner for something vegetarian"
    V->>C: modifyPlan(text)
    C->>F: modifyPlan(text)
    alt no current plan
        F-->>V: "Generate a plan first" (nothing changes)
    else plan exists
        F->>A: interpretPlanEdit(currentPlan, text, profile)
        alt LLM available
            A->>L: complete(plan slots + acceptable recipes + text)
            L-->>A: {operation, day, mealType, replacementRecipeId}
            A->>A: verify target slot and recipe id
            A->>PV: checkRecipe(replacement, profile)
            opt invalid answer
                A->>L: revision request with the error (once)
            end
        else no LLM
            A->>P: parse(text, plan, recipes, profile)
        end
        A-->>F: EditInterpretation(PlanEdit or message, trace)
        alt edit available
            F->>F: createEditCommand(edit, plan)
            F->>X: execute(command)
            X->>K: execute()
            K->>M: replaceMeal(old, new) / removeMeal(meal)
            M->>SY: onMealPlanChanged(plan)
            SY->>SY: rebuild shopping list
            F-->>V: PlanEditResult(applied=true)
        else ambiguous / unsupported / invalid
            F-->>V: PlanEditResult(applied=false, explanation)
        end
    end
    Note over U,SY: Later: undo -> CommandExecutor.undoLast() -> command.undo() -> MealPlan notifies observer again
